  "description": "Rumor has it that Ba-Ram Oh had an affair with her married art professor. It’s been four years since that debacle, and now she’s back at campus to try and enjoy her college life. But she’s not the only thing who’s returned: there’s rumors of a water ghost roaming the halls, and it just might be following her around. \n\n(Source: WEBTOON)",
